WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Phunziroli likusonyeza maonekedwe a kutsogolo kwa diso m'zitsanzo za glaucoma.

00:00:45.957 --> 00:01:05.957
Zithunzi zapafupi zikusonyeza cornea, iris ndi mwana wa diso kuchokera mbali zosiyanasiyana.

00:01:31.913 --> 00:01:51.913
Chitsanzo china chikusonyezedwa pansi pa kuwala kwamphamvu koyezera.
